# WASM PWA: most of share/ is embedded in gcompris-qt.data (MEMFS preload).
# Keep data3 visible because non-default voice packs are lazy-loaded as
# same-origin files. Keep rcc/*.rcc too: with lazy-loading, per-activity
# resource packs are removed from the preload and fetched same-origin at
# runtime, and the service worker precaches the metadata packs
# (activities_light.rcc, core.rcc, menu.rcc), so all of them must be deployed.
pwa/share/
!pwa/share/
!pwa/share/gcompris-qt/
pwa/share/gcompris-qt/*
!pwa/share/gcompris-qt/rcc/
pwa/share/gcompris-qt/rcc/*
!pwa/share/gcompris-qt/rcc/*.rcc
!pwa/share/gcompris-qt/rcc/data3/
!pwa/share/gcompris-qt/rcc/data3/**
